config MSSTORE_LASTKMSG
    bool "Persistent last_kmsg RAM crash logger"
    depends on PRINTK && PANIC_NOTIFIER && OF
    default n
    help
      This driver reserves a RAM buffer and records kernel printk
      output into it. When the kernel panics or userspace triggers
      a fatal reboot, the buffer is frozen and can be read back
      from /dev/last_kmsg on the next boot.

      Similar to Samsung last_kmsg and Android pstore RAM backends.
